# Claude Code state written into the tree by a spawned agent. `~/` is what an
# unexpanded tilde becomes when a child is spawned without HOME/USERPROFILE — it
# is a literal directory, and one such tree (a 284 KB transcript) was committed
# before the child env was fixed. `.claude/` is the same state under a real home.
~/
.claude/
